Output docs/assets/games/rs-connect-four.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 520
Set Padding 10
Set TypingSpeed 0
Hide
Type "clear && games/rs-connect-four/target/release/rs-connect-four --lang en replay games/rs-connect-four/examples/records/standard-red-wins.c4rec --interval 700"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 18.5s
